          "settings": {
            "parameters": {
              "info": {
                "labels": [],
                "layer": "HAL",
                "init_type": "called",
                "note": "MPU default configuration:\\n\\nBecause the instruction cache is enabled, the MPU must be enabled with the OTP/RO data area defined as a non-cacheable read-only region (0x08FF FE00-0x08FF FFFF range cover the full area) if the region is effectively used"
